=== Adapter tests: fixture, signed gating, signature assertion ===
     1	"""CP-7 venue adapter tests — T_ADAPTER_SUBMIT / T_ADAPTER_DUPLICATE /
     2	T_ADAPTER_LOST_ACK, the five-operations law, "no silent retries", the wire-map
     3	conformance fixture, adapter-owned state immutability, signed-endpoint
     4	fail-closed gating and the AI.8 rate bucket.
     5
     6	The venue is a TEST DOUBLE (``tests/fake_toobit_responder.py``): no network, no
     7	real credentials, nothing outside the sandbox (G9).
     8	"""
     9	from __future__ import annotations
    10
    11	import asyncio
    12	import dataclasses
    13	import hashlib
    14	import json
    15	from pathlib import Path
    16
    17	import pytest
    18
